units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.308
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
region target block 0 20 0 20 -41.5 -1.5 units lattice
region simbox block 0 20 0 20 -41.5 20 units lattice
create_box 1 simbox
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 1 region target
mass 1 92.90638
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
group projectile region projectile
group target region target
timestep 0.001
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
run 100000
velocity projectile set 0 0 -20 sum yes units box
fix 2 all nve
run 100000
